- Follow Shadcn UI's component guidelines for consistent styling and behavior.
- Customize components using the provided utility classes rather than modifying the source.
- Ensure accessibility by using Shadcn UI's built-in accessibility features.
- Keep your UI components organized and reusable across your application.
- Utilize Shadcn UI's dark mode support for a seamless user experience.